										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">WWE has announced the following for tonight&#8217;s WWE SmackDown, which takes place from the Ford Center in Evansville, Indiana.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-WarGames Advantage Match: Charlotte Flair vs. Jade Cargill</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Bakusai (Shinsuke Nakamura and Kyoki) vs. The War Raiders (Erik and Ivar)</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Non-Title Match: United States Champion Trick Williams vs. Damian Priest</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">-Cody Rhodes reveals the final member of Team USA for Survivor Series</p>



<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li></li>
</ul>
