		<item>
		<title>Recent rumor says Roman Reigns had influence in creative direction for top star at SummerSlam</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398015-recent-rumor-says-roman-reigns-had-influence-in-creative-direction-for-top-star-at-summerslam/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398015-recent-rumor-says-roman-reigns-had-influence-in-creative-direction-for-top-star-at-summerslam/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:31:07 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Featured Top Story]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Oba Femi]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Roman Reigns]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[SummerSlam]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398015</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>According to a column from Conrad Thompson posted to Uncrowned, Roman Reigns is rumored to have had influence&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398015-recent-rumor-says-roman-reigns-had-influence-in-creative-direction-for-top-star-at-summerslam/">Recent rumor says Roman Reigns had influence in creative direction for top star at SummerSlam</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">According to a column from Conrad Thompson posted to <a href="https://sports.yahoo.com/wrestling/article/roman-reigns-pushed-for-major-last-minute-change-in-oba-femis-wwe-summerslam-match-this-past-august-234446645.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Uncrowned</a>, Roman Reigns is rumored to have had influence in the creative direction for Oba Femi at Night One of WWE SummerSlam.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Thompson says that Reigns strongly advocated for <a href="https://sports.yahoo.com/wrestling/live/wwe-summerslam-night-1-results-grades-analysis-oba-femi-conquers-brock-lesnar-in-brutal-torch-passing-punk-retains-orton-returns-060000615.html">Femi&#8217;s Hell in a Cell victory over Brock Lesnar</a> to replace CM Punk&#8217;s WWE Undisputed Championship defense against Cody Rhodes as the main event for Night One. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Thompson also writes that the biggest match for WrestleMania 43 is almost going to be Reigns defending the World Heavyweight Championship against Femi, further stating Reigns himself certainly expects that match to happen. Thompson also adds the rumor is that Reigns has been using his voice backstage to keep Femi as strong as possible until the two have their match. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Femi won the King of the Ring at Night of Champions, which made him the top challenger to Reigns for the WWE World Heavyweight Championship at SummerSlam.  However, there were reports stating that WWE changed course in order to build up Femi as a much bigger star, so that when he finally challenges Reigns, the match will have a more big time feel to it. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398015-recent-rumor-says-roman-reigns-had-influence-in-creative-direction-for-top-star-at-summerslam/">Recent rumor says Roman Reigns had influence in creative direction for top star at SummerSlam</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/398015-recent-rumor-says-roman-reigns-had-influence-in-creative-direction-for-top-star-at-summerslam/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>SPOILERS: Titles change hands at 11-19-26 TNA IMPACT television tapings</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398010-spoilers-titles-change-hands-at-11-19-26-tna-impact-television-tapings/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398010-spoilers-titles-change-hands-at-11-19-26-tna-impact-television-tapings/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 14:07:26 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Impact News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact Wrestling News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Impact]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Spoilers]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[tapings]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[title changes]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TNA]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398010</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>PWInsider Elite reports that two titles changed hands at Thursday night TNA tapings at the WinSport Event Centre&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398010-spoilers-titles-change-hands-at-11-19-26-tna-impact-television-tapings/">SPOILERS: Titles change hands at 11-19-26 TNA IMPACT television tapings</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">PWInsider Elite reports that two titles changed hands at Thursday night TNA tapings at the WinSport Event Centre in Calgary, Alberta, Canada.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">AJ Francis defeated Jason Hotch to win the International Title and Elayna Black won the TNA Knockouts Television Championship from M By Elegance. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">These matches will air on future episodes of TNA IMPACT on AMC. </p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398010-spoilers-titles-change-hands-at-11-19-26-tna-impact-television-tapings/">SPOILERS: Titles change hands at 11-19-26 TNA IMPACT television tapings</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/impact-wrestling-news/398010-spoilers-titles-change-hands-at-11-19-26-tna-impact-television-tapings/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
	</channel>
</rss>
